      "message": "fix(test): wire_dxf_selection sets the start pick through picks after #3871\n\nPR #3871 moved WireContourOp::start into picks: PathPicks; PR #3942\nmerged after it with a test that still set start, so the app tests no\nlonger compiled on main. The two sites now use the same PathPicks form\nas the other wire tests.\n\nFixes #3952\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
